      <Docs>
        <summary>The key for an intent extra containing the requested contact-data MIME types.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>The picker displays contacts with data for at least one requested MIME type and returns only data for the requested types. Supply one or more of these MIME types:</para>
          <list type="bullet">
            <item><description><see cref="F:Android.Provider.ContactsContract.CommonDataKinds.StructuredName.ContentItemType" /></description></item>
            <item><description><see cref="F:Android.Provider.ContactsContract.CommonDataKinds.Email.ContentItemType" /></description></item>
            <item><description><see cref="F:Android.Provider.ContactsContract.CommonDataKinds.Phone.ContentItemType" /></description></item>
            <item><description><see cref="F:Android.Provider.ContactsContract.CommonDataKinds.StructuredPostal.ContentItemType" /></description></item>
            <item><description><see cref="F:Android.Provider.ContactsContract.CommonDataKinds.Organization.ContentItemType" /></description></item>
            <item><description><see cref="F:Android.Provider.ContactsContract.CommonDataKinds.Relation.ContentItemType" /></description></item>
            <item><description><see cref="F:Android.Provider.ContactsContract.CommonDataKinds.Event.ContentItemType" /></description></item>
            <item><description><see cref="F:Android.Provider.ContactsContract.CommonDataKinds.Photo.ContentItemType" /></description></item>
            <item><description><see cref="F:Android.Provider.ContactsContract.CommonDataKinds.GroupMembership.ContentItemType" /></description></item>
            <item><description><see cref="F:Android.Provider.ContactsContract.CommonDataKinds.Website.ContentItemType" /></description></item>
            <item><description><see cref="F:Android.Provider.ContactsContract.CommonDataKinds.Nickname.ContentItemType" /></description></item>
          </list>
          <para>If <see cref="F:Android.Provider.ContactsPickerSessionContract.ExtraPickContactsMatchAllDataFields" /> is true, only contacts with data for all requested MIME types are displayed.</para>
          <para>The picker throws <see cref="T:Java.Lang.IllegalArgumentException" /> if a requested MIME type is not in this list.</para>
          <para>Clients must set this extra so that the picker can determine which information to make available. Use <see cref="M:Android.Content.Intent.PutStringArrayListExtra(System.String,System.Collections.Generic.IList{System.String})" /> to supply the list.</para>
          <code lang="text/java">    List&lt;String&gt; requestedMimeTypes = new ArrayList&lt;&gt;();
    requestedMimeTypes.add(ContactsContract.CommonDataKinds.Email.CONTENT_ITEM_TYPE);
    requestedMimeTypes.add(ContactsContract.CommonDataKinds.Phone.CONTENT_ITEM_TYPE);
    intent.putStringArrayListExtra(
            ContactsPickerSessionContract.EXTRA_PICK_CONTACTS_REQUESTED_DATA_FIELDS,
            (ArrayList&lt;String&gt;) requestedMimeTypes);</code>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/provider/ContactsPickerSessionContract#EXTRA_PICK_CONTACTS_REQUESTED_DATA_FIELDS" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.provider.ContactsPickerSessionContract.EXTRA_PICK_CONTACTS_REQUESTED_DATA_FIELDS</code>.</a></format></para>
